{"id":"3f8f3a8be6b88d18","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-tm-initial-configuration.md","title":"Turing Machine Initial Configuration","display":"df-tm-initial-configuration — Turing Machine Initial Configuration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-tm-initial-configuration","aliases":["88-df-tm-initial-configuration"],"display":"df-tm-initial-configuration — Turing Machine Initial Configuration","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-configuration]]","[[88-df-tm-tape]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-tm-initial-configuration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-tm-initial-configuration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-initial-configuration — Turing Machine Initial Configuration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb6aa5db0f2eb060\" href=\"?note=fb6aa5db0f2eb060\" title=\"88-df-tm-configuration\">88-df-tm-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c412569a8bba638b\" href=\"?note=c412569a8bba638b\" title=\"88-df-tm-tape\">88-df-tm-tape</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> (Turing machine, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\\)</span> (finite input word)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)\\)</span> (finite-support tape, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c412569a8bba638b\" href=\"?note=c412569a8bba638b\" title=\"88-df-tm-tape\">88-df-tm-tape</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}_M(c)\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}_M(c)\\)</span> (configuration predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fb6aa5db0f2eb060\" href=\"?note=fb6aa5db0f2eb060\" title=\"88-df-tm-configuration\">88-df-tm-configuration</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M\">\\(q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M\\)</span> (start-state projection, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,c)\">\\(\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,c)\\)</span> (initial-configuration predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}initial\\text{-}configuration} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,c)\n\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\n\\land\\mathrm{Conf}_M(c)\n\\land\\exists T\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\n((0\\leq j\\land j&lt;|w|)\\to T(j)=w_j)\n\\land((j&lt;0\\lor |w|\\leq j)\\to T(j)=B_M)\n\\bigr)\n\\land c=\\langle q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,T,0\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}initial\\text{-}configuration} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,c)\n\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\n\\land\\mathrm{Conf}_M(c)\n\\land\\exists T\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\n((0\\leq j\\land j&lt;|w|)\\to T(j)=w_j)\n\\land((j&lt;0\\lor |w|\\leq j)\\to T(j)=B_M)\n\\bigr)\n\\land c=\\langle q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,T,0\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>输入占据从位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始的有限区间，其余位置均为空白符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_M\">\\(B_M\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>本谓词是停机、接受与输出定义共享的唯一起始配置来源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"fb6aa5db0f2eb060","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-configuration]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-tape","status":"resolved","id":"c412569a8bba638b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-tape]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ (Turing machine, see [[88-df-turing-machine]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-tape","status":"resolved","id":"c412569a8bba638b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)$ (finite-support tape, see [[88-df-tm-tape]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"fb6aa5db0f2eb060","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Conf}_M(c)$ (configuration predicate, see [[88-df-tm-configuration]])","embed":false}